Well, you know, actually, originally when they were like...

404
00:29:21,090 --> 00:29:22,540
"So we're going to do the Neko Switcheroo,

405
00:29:22,540 --> 00:29:24,490
You're singing whatever who song you want to sing."

406
00:29:24,490 --> 00:29:27,540
And I said, "I'mama, please let me do I'mama! I want to sing Seikyu Takoo!"

407
00:29:27,540 --> 00:29:30,190
And I was like... I was like the first, I think, to shout out.

408
00:29:30,190 --> 00:29:31,990
So I know how much you love that song.

409
00:29:31,990 --> 00:29:34,240
