410
00:29:34,240 --> 00:29:36,490
And I like that you changed the lyrics too.

411
00:29:36,490 --> 00:29:38,290
"I'm not just a Phoenix, I'm a tenchou!"

412
00:29:38,290 --> 00:29:39,390
Yeah, something like that.

413
00:29:39,390 --> 00:29:41,290
It was cute.

414
00:29:41,290 --> 00:29:42,190
So desu ne.

415
00:29:42,490 --> 00:29:45,040
